{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 158,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.96435546875,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "BCG vaccination plays a decisive role in reducing the specificity of the TST, although the GDG",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.964599609375,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "noted that the impact of BCG vaccination on the specificity of the TST depends on the strain",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.9259033203125,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "of vaccine used, the age at which the vaccine is given and the number of doses administered.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.9921875,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "When BCG is given at birth, as is the case in most parts of the world, it has a variable, limited",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        214.85330200195312,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "impact on TST specificity  . (19)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.16522216796875,
        526.965576171875,
        168.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "The GDG agreed that a history of BCG vaccination has a limited effect on interpretation of TST",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.66522216796875,
        526.947998046875,
        183.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "results later in life; hence, BCG vaccination should not be a determining factor in selecting a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.16522216796875,
        527.013916015625,
        199.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "test. Neither the TST nor IGRAs are to be used to diagnose active TB disease; also, they are not",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.66522216796875,
        431.4732971191406,
        214.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "to be used for diagnostic work-up of adults suspected of having active TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.1767120361328,
        191.30810546875,
        243.5567169189453
      ],
      "text": "Research priorities",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        253.8076171875,
        526.8928833007812,
        266.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "There is a critical need for diagnostic tests with improved performance and predictive value for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984639167785645,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.3076171875,
        527.0401000976562,
        282.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "progression to active TB. In addition, the performance of TB infection tests should be evaluated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.975723266601562,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        284.8076171875,
        526.9038696289062,
        297.95263671875
      ],
      "text": "in various risk groups, to assess reinfection and to understand how best to use available tools",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.3076171875,
        463.0755615234375,
        313.45263671875
      ],
      "text": "in each population (e.g. in combination, or sequential use of the TST and IGRAs).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        324.3116149902344,
        526.9918823242188,
        337.4566345214844
      ],
      "text": "Data synthesis was structured around the preset PICO question, as outlined above. See Web",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.8116149902344,
        416.61309814453125,
        352.9566345214844
      ],
      "text": "Annex H for additional information on evidence synthesis and analysis.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        380.8064270019531,
        494.3855895996094,
        403.0364074707031
      ],
      "text": "3.3. TB skin tests and interferon gamma release",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        403.6064147949219,
        398.6635437011719,
        425.8363952636719
      ],
      "text": "assays for the diagnosis of TB disease",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        436.4350280761719,
        186.8113250732422,
        452.81500244140625
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41439819335938,
        475.0679931640625,
        512.4013671875,
        487.98199462890625
      ],
      "text": "20.\tInterferon-gamma release assays (IGRAs) (and the tuberculin skin test [TST])",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        490.5679931640625,
        512.4548950195312,
        503.48199462890625
      ],
      "text": "should not be used in low- and middle-income countries for the diagnosis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        506.0679931640625,
        512.4000244140625,
        518.9819946289062
      ],
      "text": "of pulmonary or extrapulmonary TB, or for the diagnostic work-up of adults",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        521.5679931640625,
        488.9919128417969,
        534.4819946289062
      ],
      "text": "(including people living with HIV) suspected of active TB in these settings",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        539.9356079101562,
        229.4243621826172,
        552.8165893554688
      ],
      "text": "(strong recommendation)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        574.30078125,
        526.8370361328125,
        587.44580078125
      ],
      "text": "The Guideline Development Group concluded that both the sensitivity and specificity of IGRAs in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        589.80078125,
        526.8902587890625,
        602.94580078125
      ],
      "text": "detecting active TB among individuals presumed of having TB were suboptimal and the quality",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.976825714111328,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.30078125,
        526.9149780273438,
        618.44580078125
      ],
      "text": "of evidence was low. They also recommended that these tests not be used as a replacement",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        620.80078125,
        467.4756164550781,
        633.94580078125
      ],
      "text": "for conventional microbiological diagnosis of pulmonary and extrapulmonary TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        644.8046875,
        527.124755859375,
        657.94970703125
      ],
      "text": "The Guideline Development Group noted that current evidence did not support the use of IGRAs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        660.3046875,
        526.712890625,
        673.44970703125
      ],
      "text": "or the TST as part of the diagnostic work-up of adults presumed of active TB, irrespective of HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.978128433227539,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.8046875,
        526.848388671875,
        688.94970703125
      ],
      "text": "status. This recommendation placed a high value on avoiding the consequences of unnecessary",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.961583137512207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        691.3046875,
        526.9656982421875,
        704.44970703125
      ],
      "text": "treatment (owing to a high number of false positive results), given the low specificity of IGRAs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        706.8046875,
        213.09429931640625,
        719.94970703125
      ],
      "text": "and the TST in these settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.466400146484375,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "142 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}